{"visibility": "domain", "fields": [{"name": "annee", "description": null, "annotations": {"timeserie_precision": "year"}, "label": "annee", "type": "date"}, {"name": "risque", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "risque", "type": "text"}, {"name": "code_naf1", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "code_NAF1", "type": "text"}, {"name": "libelle_naf1", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "libelle_NAF1", "type": "text"}, {"name": "naf1", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "NAF1", "type": "text"}, {"name": "code_naf5", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "code_NAF5", "type": "text"}, {"name": "libelle_naf5", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "libelle_NAF5", "type": "text"}, {"name": "naf5", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "NAF5", "type": "text"}, {"name": "nb_sinistres", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "nb_sinistres", "type": "text"}, {"name": "nb_salaries", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "nb_salaries", "type": "text"}, {"name": "indice_frequence", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "indice_frequence", "type": "text"}, {"name": "nb_sinistres_int", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "nb_sinistres_int", "type": "int"}, {"name": "nb_salaries_int", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "nb_salaries_int", "type": "int"}, {"name": "indice_frequence_int", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "indice_frequence_int", "type": "double"}], "dataset_id": "sinistralite-par-secteur-d-activite-concerne-naf-1", "dataset_uid": "da_0gn8jd", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "timeserie"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "Risques professionnels : sinistralit\u00e9 par secteur d\u2019activit\u00e9 (NAF 1 et NAF 5)", "description": "<p>\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Ce jeu de donn\u00e9es est une des\nsources de datavisualisations disponibles sur le site <a href=\"https://data.ameli.fr/pages/data-risques-professionnels/\">Data risques\nprofessionnels</a><u>.</u> </p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Informations g\u00e9n\u00e9rales :</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">La population sur laquelle est\nbas\u00e9e ce jeu de donn\u00e9es correspond aux salari\u00e9s et aux<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">\u00a0\u00a0 </span>entreprises du r\u00e9gime g\u00e9n\u00e9ral. Il s\u2019agit\nessentiellement des salari\u00e9s, des travailleurs ind\u00e9pendants ayant souscrit \u00e0\nl\u2019assurance volontaire AT/MP (Avat), ainsi que de certains agents de la\nfonction publique (contractuels, temps courts, etc.). </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Ces donn\u00e9es ne prennent pas en\ncompte\u00a0:</p><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">les exploitants et salari\u00e9s agricoles, qui\nrel\u00e8vent du r\u00e9gime agricole\u00a0; </li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style='font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"'></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style='font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"'></span></span></span>les personnels des fonctions publiques, qui sont\ncouverts par leur administration\u00a0; </li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style='font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"'></span></span></span>les travailleurs ind\u00e9pendants n\u2019ayant pas\nsouscrit \u00e0 l\u2019Avat.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Ce jeu de donn\u00e9es pr\u00e9sente des\ninformations sur les sinistres suivants :</p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style='font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"'></span></span></span>les accidents du travail\u00a0;</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style='font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"'></span></span></span>les accidents de trajet\u00a0;</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">les maladies professionnelles.<span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style='font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"'><br></span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Les informations sur ces risques\npr\u00e9sent\u00e9es sont\u00a0:</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">le nombre de sinistres\u00a0;</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style='font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"'></span></span></span>le nombre de salari\u00e9s\u00a0;</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">l\u2019indice de fr\u00e9quence.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Pour plus d'informations (source,\nchamp, d\u00e9finitions des modalit\u00e9s), consulter la page <a href=\"https://data.ameli.fr/pages/data-risques-professionnels-methode/\">M\u00e9thode</a>\ndu site.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Secret statistique :</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Par respect pour le secret\nstatistique (loi du 7 juin 1951) et afin que l\u2019identification directe ou\nindirecte des individus et des entreprises soit impossible, aucune information\nsur les risques professionnels, les salari\u00e9s et les entreprises n'est communiqu\u00e9e\nlorsque\u00a0: </p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">le nombre d\u2019entreprises est inf\u00e9rieur \u00e0 3 ; </li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">ou lorsqu\u2019une entreprise repr\u00e9sente une part\npr\u00e9dominante des salari\u00e9s (&gt; 85 %).</li></ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">La valeur de l'indicateur est\nalors indiqu\u00e9e par \u00ab NS \u00bb (non diffusable) dans le jeu de donn\u00e9es.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Abr\u00e9viations pr\u00e9sentes dans\nles donn\u00e9es :</b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\u00ab NS \u00bb = non\u00a0diffusable (application du secret\n     statistique)</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\u00ab NC \u00bb = non calcul\u00e9 (calcul non pertinent, etc.)</li></ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Couverture spatiale et\ngranularit\u00e9 :</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Ce jeu de donn\u00e9es couvre la\nFrance enti\u00e8re.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Les donn\u00e9es sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es par\nsecteurs d\u2019activit\u00e9, selon la nomenclature d\u2019activit\u00e9s fran\u00e7aise (NAF), et sont\ncat\u00e9goris\u00e9es par code NAF de niveau 1 (sections de la NAF) et code NAF de\nniveau 5 (sous-classes de la NAF). Pour plus d\u2019informations sur ce d\u00e9coupage,\nconsulter la page <a href=\"https://data.ameli.fr/pages/data-risques-professionnels-methode/\">M\u00e9thode</a>\ndu site.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Mises \u00e0 jour des donn\u00e9es :</b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">Mise \u00e0 jour du 24/08/2026 : premi\u00e8re mise en ligne\n     des donn\u00e9es, de l'ann\u00e9e 2015 \u00e0 l'ann\u00e9e 2024</li></ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Pour plus d'informations et\nd\u00e9tails sur les mises \u00e0 jour et changements op\u00e9r\u00e9s dans les donn\u00e9es (p\u00e9rim\u00e8tre,\nmode de calcul, correctif, etc.), consulter la page <a href=\"https://data.ameli.fr/pages/data-risques-professionnels-methode/\">M\u00e9thode</a>\ndu site.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Fr\u00e9quence de mise \u00e0 jour des\ndonn\u00e9es :</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Les donn\u00e9es propos\u00e9es en\nt\u00e9l\u00e9chargement dans l\u2019onglet \u00ab Export \u00bb sont mises \u00e0 jour chaque ann\u00e9e (donn\u00e9es\nde la France enti\u00e8re depuis 2015).</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Source :</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Les donn\u00e9es sont issues du\nsyst\u00e8me national de tarification des risques professionnels (SNTRP) et de la\nd\u00e9claration sociale nominative (DSN).</p>", "theme": ["Risques professionnels"], "keyword": null, "license": null, "license_url": null, "language": "fr", "modified": "2026-04-20T12:18:09+00:00", "publisher": null, "references": null, "attributions": null, "update_frequency": null, "bbox": null, "data_processed": "2026-08-17T14:29:55+00:00", "federated": false, "geographic_reference": null, "geographic_reference_auto": false, "geometry_types": null, "metadata_languages": ["fr"], "metadata_processed": "2026-08-24T14:58:27.830000+00:00", "modified_updates_on_data_change": false, "modified_updates_on_metadata_change": false, "parent_domain": "cnam", "records_count": 60480, "shared_catalog": null, "source_dataset": null, "source_domain": null, "source_domain_address": null, "source_domain_title": null, "territory": null, "timezone": null}}}